[ar:Aarav Kharade]
[ti:I WANT ATTENTION]

[00:01.64]Hey! Hey!
[00:09.03]Can you hear me in the back?
[00:10.72]Turn it up!
[00:12.53]I got something to say!
[00:14.57]One, two, three, COME ON!
[00:16.34]I got a joke, I got a smile,
[00:18.51]I can make you laugh a little while,
[00:20.60]I dance too hard, I sing too loud,
[00:22.67]I wanna be the king of this crowd!
[00:25.10]Look at me, I'm on a roll,
[00:26.78]Got a million colors in my soul,
[00:29.27]Everybody's talking, everybody's there,
[00:30.93]So why's it so hard to get somebody to care?
[00:33.29]I don't need a diamond,
[00:35.29]I don't need a crown,
[00:37.19]I just wanna know that
[00:39.23]You can see me in this town!
[00:41.95]Clap your hands, stomp your feet,
[00:43.98]Put the whole world on repeat!
[00:46.39]I WANT ATTENTION!
[00:47.94]HEY! HEY! LOOK AT ME!
[00:50.16]I WANNA BE SOMEBODY
[00:51.95]THAT THE WHOLE WORLD SEES!
[00:54.47]I WANT ATTENTION!
[00:56.42]OH, CAN'T YOU UNDERSTAND?
[00:58.55]I'M JUST A LITTLE HUMAN
[01:00.62]TRYING TO MAKE A STAND!
[01:03.32]HEY! HEY!
[01:05.30]DON'T WALK AWAY!
[01:06.39]I GOT A MILLION THINGS
[01:07.33]I NEVER KNOW HOW TO SAY!
[01:08.50]I WANT ATTENTION!
[01:09.28]SING IT BACK TO ME!
[01:10.59]I WANNA FEEL LIKE I EXIST
[01:11.79]WHEN NOBODY'S WATCHING ME!
[01:12.98]Na-na-na-na, LOOK AT ME!
[01:15.09]Na-na-na-na, CAN YOU SEE?
[01:17.29]Hands up high, we're feeling free!
[01:19.34]Somebody, somebody, NOTICE ME!
[01:21.85]Na-na-na-na, LOOK AT ME!
[01:24.02]Na-na-na-na, CAN YOU SEE?
[01:26.21]Hands up high, we're feeling free!
[01:28.46]Somebody, somebody, NOTICE ME!
[01:30.46]I post a picture, check my phone,
[01:32.24]Refresh the page, I'm not alone...
[01:34.65]Well, that's what I tell myself at night,
[01:36.57]While a little red number makes everything right.
[01:38.88]I make them laugh, I play the fool,
[01:40.80]I break the rules to look so cool,
[01:42.86]And if the room goes quiet when I walk inside,
[01:44.81]I turn the music up and dance away the night!
[01:47.22]Maybe I'm dramatic,
[01:48.44]Maybe that's my style,
[01:50.19]Maybe I could hide it
[01:52.20]Behind another smile!
[01:55.93]But if I'm so amazing,
[01:57.42]If I'm shining like the sun,
[01:59.20]Why do I feel invisible
[02:01.61]When the day is done?
[02:06.27]I WANT ATTENTION!
[02:08.34]HEY! HEY! LOOK AT ME!
[02:10.33]I WANNA BE SOMEBODY
[02:12.48]THAT THE WHOLE WORLD SEES!
[02:15.03]I WANT ATTENTION!
[02:16.76]OH, CAN'T YOU UNDERSTAND?
[02:18.78]I'M JUST A LITTLE HUMAN
[02:20.81]TRYING TO MAKE A STAND!
[02:23.92]HEY! HEY!
[02:25.15]DON'T WALK AWAY!
[02:26.63]I GOT A MILLION THINGS
[02:27.55]I NEVER KNOW HOW TO SAY!
[02:28.78]I WANT ATTENTION!
[02:29.61]SING IT BACK TO ME!
[02:30.94]I WANNA FEEL LIKE I EXIST
[02:32.03]WHEN NOBODY'S WATCHING ME!
[02:33.44]Na-na-na-na, LOOK AT ME!
[02:35.25]Na-na-na-na, CAN YOU SEE?
[02:37.59]Hands up high, we're feeling free!
[02:39.73]Somebody, somebody, NOTICE ME!
[02:42.17]And when the lights go out,
[02:44.88]And the cheering disappears,
[02:46.92]Will you still remember me
[02:49.08]When nobody else is here?
[02:51.31]If I never make the headlines,
[02:53.16]If my name is never known,
[02:55.43]Would I still be worth remembering
[02:57.59]If I stood here on my own?
[02:59.97]No camera.
[03:00.72]No applause.
[03:01.54]No perfect little smile.
[03:03.39]Just somebody hoping
[03:05.45]To matter for a while.
[03:07.47]HEY!
[03:08.73]Maybe we all want it!
[03:09.43]Maybe we all do!
[03:10.19]Maybe every face you see
[03:11.11]Is hiding something too!
[03:12.15]So if you see somebody
[03:13.02]Trying hard to shine...
[03:14.08]Don't just watch the show, my friend!
[03:16.05]**MAKE THEM FEEL ALIVE!**
[03:20.38]I WANT ATTENTION!
[03:22.29]HEY! HEY! LOOK AT ME!
[03:24.08]BUT I'LL GIVE YOU MY ATTENTION,
[03:26.15]YOU CAN COME AND DANCE WITH ME!
[03:28.61]WE WANT ATTENTION!
[03:30.58]EVERY HEART, EVERY NAME!
[03:32.84]WE'RE ALL JUST TRYING TO BE SEEN
[03:35.14]IN THIS CRAZY LITTLE GAME!
[03:37.80]HEY! HEY!
[03:39.52]NOW I UNDERSTAND!
[03:40.75]SOMETIMES SOMEBODY NEEDS
[03:42.79]MORE THAN A CHEERING CROWD AND A BAND!
[03:44.86]WE WANT ATTENTION!
[03:46.73]LET THE WHOLE WORLD SEE!
[03:49.27]YOU DON'T HAVE TO BE A STAR
[03:52.00]TO MEAN EVERYTHING TO ME!
[03:55.72]Na-na-na-na, look at me!
[03:57.82]Na-na-na-na, you and me!
[04:00.02]Na-na-na-na, finally free!
[04:01.86]No gold, no fame, no fantasy...
[04:04.89]Just look my way.
[04:08.30]And I'll look at you.
[04:15.60]HEY! HEY!
